# The context of Server/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): only what the server-only configure and
# the DesertServer build read. Everything else (content, docs, frames, the .git history, build trees) stays out.
*
!CMakeLists.txt
!CMakePresets.json
!VERSION
!cmake
!BuildScripts
!scripts/GenVersion.sh
!scripts/Dev/ccache_launcher.sh
!Desert
!Tools
!Server
!ThirdParty
# Configured by the vendored-library list (cmake/ThirdParty/Assimp.cmake), never built for the server.
!Editor/ThirdParty/assimp
# A layout header shared with the shaders (LandscapeData.cpp); headers only.
!Editor/Resources/Shaders
# Render-only and Windows-only vendored trees the Linux server configure never opens.
ThirdParty/FidelityFX-SDK
ThirdParty/NVRHI
ThirdParty/lightweightvk
ThirdParty/sol2
**/.git
Desert/Tests
